<title>USA: Reckson Associates to buy office complex.</title>
<headline>Reckson Associates to buy office complex.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reckson Associates Realty Corp said on Tuesday it agreed to buy Landmark Square, a six building office complex in Stamford, Conn., for $79 million from Metropolitan Life Insurance Co.</p>
<p>Reckson said it plans to start an $11.5 million, five-year capital improvement program to upgrade the properties.</p>
<p>Reckson said it expects its initial return on total investment to be about 10.25 percent, with its stabilized return on total investment exceeding 11 percent.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close early in the fourth quarter of 1996, Reckson said.</p>
</text>
